      "trace_id": "cd09e7a84d3fd4cdbc1f21b73e8cb990",
      "output": {
        "question": "What happened to Teleborian in the end of the court?",
        "answer": "At the end of the court proceedings, Dr. Peter Teleborian was arrested in the courtroom by police officers from the special investigations division. He was arrested for violation of the law on child pornography, specifically for possession of approximately nine thousand pornographic photographs of children found on his computer [E1] [E2]. The arrest occurred while the trial regarding Lisbeth Salander was still ongoing, after his testimony had been discredited by Mikael Blomkvist and Superintendent Torsten Edklinth [E3].",
        "citations": [
          "[E1]",
          "[E2]",
          "[E3]"
        ],
        "reranked": [
          {
            "book": "The Girl Who Kicked the Hornet's Nest",
            "book_file": "The Girl Who Kicked the Hornet's Nest -- Stieg Larsson -- Millennium Trilogy #3, 2010 -- Random House, Inc_ -- a9a1c0e6f4b8fd47fa0771ff9463bc34 -- Anna’s Archive.epub",
            "section": "OEBPS/Lars_9780307593672_epub_c27_r1.htm",
            "paragraph": 454,
            "part": 1,
            "chapter": "CHAPTER 27 Friday, July 15",
            "page": null,
            "text": "“And what is your business here?” Judge Iversen said.\n“We are here to arrest Peter Teleborian with your permission, and without wishing to disturb the court’s proceedings.”\nJudge Iversen looked at Advokat Giannini.\n“I’m not quite finished with him . . . but the court may have heard enough of Dr. Teleborian.”\n“You have my permission,” Judge Iversen said to the police officers.\nCollsjö walked across to Teleborian. “Peter Teleborian, you are under arrest for violation of the law on child pornography.”",
            "paragraph_end": 459,
            "part_end": 1,
            "embedding_model": "sentence-transformers/multi-qa-MiniLM-L6-cos-v1",
            "source_id": "93ec354d2b66e5ece989e2c562096dad4e542fda6beeb7a41f448c5da28bc149",
            "id": "93ec354d-2b66-e5ec-e989-e2c562096dad",
            "score": 2.8271584510803223,
            "agent_label": "E1"
          },
          {
