            "chapter": "CHAPTER 27 Friday, July 15",
            "page": null,
            "text": "Teleborian sat still, hardly breathing. Giannini saw that all the light in his eyes seemed to have been extinguished.\n“Specifically, for possession of approximately nine thousand pornographic photographs of children found on your computer.”\nShe bent down to pick up his laptop, which he had brought with him.\n“This is confiscated as evidence,” she said.\nAs he was being led from the courtroom, Salander’s blazing eyes bored into Teleborian’s back.",
            "paragraph_end": 464,
            "part_end": 1,
            "embedding_model": "sentence-transformers/multi-qa-MiniLM-L6-cos-v1",
            "source_id": "2f0f62a1ded645e250e25d35ecd087f72159d0d1c02232fd6f071e5b66f670ce",
